  "number": "44",
  "title": "函数的和的导数",
  "printed_title": "44. 函数的和的导数",
  "start_page": 162,
  "start_printed": 155,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 4,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设 $u$ 和 $v$ 是定义在同一个区间上的两个函数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 155,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0162#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理. 如果两个函数都有导数，那么它们的和的导数等于它们的导数的和，即",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 155,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0162#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(u(x)+v(x))'=u'(x)+v'(x)$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 155,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0162#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "证明 用 $w(x)$ 表示这两个函数的和 $u(x)+v(x)$，并计算 $w(x)$ 的导数：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 155,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0162#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\Delta w(x)}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{w(x+\\Delta x)-w(x)}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{u(x+\\Delta x)+v(x+\\Delta x)-u(x)-v(x)}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{u(x+\\Delta x)-u(x)+v(x+\\Delta x)-v(x)}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{\\Delta u}{\\Delta x}+\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta x}$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 155,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0162#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 155,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0162#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(u+v)'=w'=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{\\Delta w(x)}{\\Delta x}=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\left(\\frac{\\Delta u}{\\Delta x}+\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta x}\\right)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{\\Delta u}{\\Delta x}+\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta x}=u'+v'$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 155,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0162#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理证毕.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 155,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0162#15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "注　用数学归纳法可以证明，这个定理对任意有限个函数的和也正确：$(u_1+u_2+\\cdots+u_n)'=u_1'+u_2'+\\cdots+u_n'.$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 156,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0163#1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
